{"3819620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astra Industria", "steam_appid": 3819620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build colossal space megastructures, experience the grand scale, and craft fully customizable production recipes. The gameplay is easy to learn, yet the depth of the systems and the emergent challenges provides a serious test for players who love min-maxing and optimization.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/9618c3ba3d41d48045acf56f952705d2.avif?t=1786421498\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras_big/9618c3ba3d41d48045acf56f952705d2.avif?t=1786421498 width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.poster.avif?t=1786421498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.webm?t=1786421498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819620/extras/a862b61feb1056405d71a0c2c953246e.mp4?t=1786421498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target individual asteroids, scan for hidden deposits, and extract raw materials with precise clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rock formation is unique. Some teem with rare metals, others hide crystalline minerals. So choose wisely to build the foundation of your galactic empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas